OL,3,AElon Musk says record spending on US
OL,4,Amidterms was 'pretty foolish'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDemocrats won control of the both
OL,7,Fchambers in the US Congress, flipping
OL,8,Fboth swing seats and making historic
OL,9,Fgains in places that have for decades
OL,10,Fbeen controlled by Republicans.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/18
